<title>RUSSIA: Chelyabenergo 1996 IAS net profit 640 bln rbls.</title>
<headline>Chelyabenergo 1996 IAS net profit 640 bln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31--</p>
<p> (bln rbls)		  1996		     1995</p>
<p> Net sales		 5,739.2		  3,952.0</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	    867.9		    501.3</p>
<p> Net profit		  640.1		    354.7</p>
<p> Undistributed profit	0.0		    143.2</p>
<p>NOTES -- Full company name is AO Energetiki i Elektrifikatsii Chelyabenergo.</p>
<p>Figures prepared to international accounting standards.</p>
<p>Earlier this year Chelyabenergo posted 902.8 billion roubles ($156.7 million) 1996 pre-tax profit prepared to Russian standards against 429.4 billion roubles in 1995.</p>
<p>National power company UES owns 58 percent of Chelyabenergo and the Chelyabinsk region property fund owns a further 15.7 percent.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520 ($ = 5761 Russian Roubles)</p>
</text>
